                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </figure>

            <p><b>The amended rule.</b> An explicit formatter pin is a one-line fix only when the
              documentation build already resolves ex_doc 0.40 or newer. <code>mix.exs</code> permitting a
              current ex_doc is not sufficient — <code>mix.lock</code> decides. Verify on the committed
              branch with the restored lockfile:</p>

            <pre><code>mix deps.get
mix docs
test -f doc/llms.txt</code></pre>

            <p>Running <code>mix deps.update ex_doc</code> first proves future compatibility, not that the
              branch you are proposing builds.</p>
